offer = Let's find you a home.
offerBody = My work has a place here. Now I would love a home of my own. Build a house or use one with a free room, then assign me at its Town Records Shelf.
accept = I'll make a home for you.
later = Another time.
remind = About your house...
remindBody = Use the house plot token to build a home, or choose an existing house with a free room. Assign me at its Town Records Shelf, then come back and talk to me.
finish = Your home is ready.
finishBody = A roof of my own! Thank you for giving me a real home in town.
back = Back.
